I am in the bathroom.
The water is nicely warm.
I wash myself.
Then I take my toothbrush.
I brush my teeth.
That takes three minutes.
After that, I go into my bedroom.
I open my wardrobe.
What do I put on today?
It is January.
The winter in Berlin is still very cold.
I need warm clothes.
I take a pair of jeans.
And I look for a thick sweater.
I get dressed quickly.
The sweater is big and comfortable.
Now I am ready.
I take my backpack and my laptop.
